@startuml
title Sequence — публикация и сохранение события
autonumber
actor "Spring Scheduler" as scheduler
participant "Event Producer" as producer
participant "KafkaTemplate" as template
queue "Kafka topic: events" as kafka
participant "Event Consumer\n(group: event-group)" as consumer
participant "EventRepository" as repository
database "PostgreSQL" as postgres

scheduler -> producer : sendEvent()
activate producer
producer -> producer : Event(uid=UUID, subject, description)
producer -> template : send(ProducerRecord(topic, uid, event))
template ->> kafka : publish(key=uid, value=Avro Event)
template --> producer : CompletableFuture (не ожидается)
deactivate producer

kafka ->> consumer : poll / deliver Event
activate consumer
consumer -> consumer : Event -> EventEntity
consumer -> repository : save(entity)
repository -> postgres : INSERT event_entity
postgres --> repository : generated id
repository --> consumer : saved entity
deactivate consumer

note over producer,kafka
Отправка асинхронная: код не обрабатывает
успех или ошибку CompletableFuture.
end note
note over consumer,postgres
Этот участок выполнится только после добавления
event-consumer в среду запуска.
end note
@enduml
